# "Their controllers sacrifice them" (CR 701.21a: a permanent is sacrificed by its controller). Bot1 takes Bot2's Kird Ape
# with Control Magic, then casts City in a Bottle: its state trigger triggers (CR 603.8) and Bot1, Kird Ape's controller,
# sacrifices it - to its owner Bot2's graveyard. Its owner, who doesn't control it, couldn't sacrifice it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Control Magic
City in a Bottle
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Kird Ape
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Kird Ape.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Control Magic.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Kird Ape)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Kird Ape.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.City in a Bottle.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Kird Ape
Bot1.Graveyard = Control Magic; Black Lotus
